## 🛠️ Stack & Runtime Constraints
- **Language / Runtime**: Python 3.11+ / Node.js 20+
- **Primary Framework**: FastAPI / React 19
- **Storage / Database**: SQLite (WAL mode) / PostgreSQL

## 🏛️ Domain Architectural Invariants
- **Layering**: Strictly decouple Business Domain from Presentation and External Adapters (PRINCIPLE-009).
- **Type Annotations**: Mandatory type hints on all public interfaces and DTOs; zero `Any` casting.
- **Concurrency**: Asynchronous non-blocking I/O only; zero synchronous blocking operations on the event loop.

## 🧪 Verification & Tooling
- **Test Command**: `pytest tests/ -v` (must execute in <2s with 100% pass gate).
- **Linter / Formatter**: `ruff check .` (zero warnings before commit).
